      "id": "rxwr85u",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Background of the Indian Constitution"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Constituent Assembly was set up in November 1946 under the framework of the Cabinet Mission Plan.",
        "Dr. Sachchidananda Sinha was appointed as the temporary President, succeeded by Dr. Rajendra Prasad as permanent President.",
        "Dr. B.R. Ambedkar headed the 7-member Drafting Committee, responsible for framing the Constitution.",
        "The Constitution was adopted on 26th November 1949 and came into full force on 26th January 1950."
      ],
      "id": "cjfovwd"
    },
